    "Core's runtime OS package layer is layer 6, sha256:88b911d6d7e4b365ace0ec63f8701f8b183760274e37d910cf1f572421be4905. Frozen Dockerfile explicitly upgrades Perl packages only; it does not explicitly upgrade util-linux or zlib.",
